      "date": "2026-01-16T10:56:00.000Z",
      "title": "Pro Clb Global Limited Announces Resignation of Non-Executive Director Niraj Nirmal Kumar Chamaria, Effective January 16, 2026",
      "body": "PRO CLB GLOBAL LIMITED announced that Mr. Niraj Nirmal Kumar Chamaria (DIN: 02062351), Non-Executive Director of the Company, has resigned from the position of Non-Executive Director effective from January 16, 2026 due to personal reasons. The resignation was communicated in compliance with Regulation 30 read with Para A of Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, and SEBI Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD1/P/CIR/2023/123 dated July 13, 2023. Mr. Chamaria confirmed that there is no other material reason for his resignation. The company is required to file Form DIR 12 with the Registrar of Companies (ROC) in accordance with the Companies Act 2013.",
