      "date": "2026-01-16T09:56:00.000Z",
      "title": "Pro Clb Global Limited Announces Resignation of Non-Executive Independent Directors Manish Agrawal and Yashvi Chaitanya Shah, Effective January 16, 2026",
      "body": "PRO CLB GLOBAL LIMITED announced that Mr. Manish Agrawal (DIN: 01962004), Non-Executive Independent Director, and Ms. Yashvi Chaitanya Shah (DIN: 08002543), Non-Executive Independent Director, have resigned from the position of Non-Executive Independent Director effective from January 16, 2026 due to pre-occupations and other professional commitments. Ms. Yashvi Chaitanya Shah holds directorship in RAJSHREE POLYPACK LIMITED. The resignation was communicated in compliance with Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015.",
